 drivers/spi/Kconfig           |  10 +
 drivers/spi/Makefile          |   1 +
 drivers/spi/spi-ma35d1-qspi.c | 658 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 669 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/spi/spi-ma35d1-qspi.c

